        call SaveReal(YDHT, GetHandleId( GetOwningPlayer(GetTriggerUnit())), 0x69A9C634, ((LoadReal(YDHT, GetHandleId( GetOwningPlayer(GetTriggerUnit())), 0x69A9C634))+( 0.04)))
    else
    endif
